# Dr.Minix menu ENTER starts, note lanes A/S/D/F/G/H/J; game ESC finishes, menu ESC exits.
at 100 key ENTER down
at 101 key ENTER up
at 420 key A down
at 425 key A up
at 450 key S down
at 455 key S up
at 480 key D down
at 485 key D up
at 500 key ESC down
at 501 key ESC up
at 700 key ESC down
at 701 key ESC up
